  "name": "Bleeding",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/skills/wounds/blood-drip-droplet-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Every round that a creature is bleeding, they must succeed a Constitution saving throw DC 15 or take 1D4+number of stacks, and gain another stack of bleeding.<br /><br />Bleeding can be cured with <a href=\"https://www.dandwiki.com/wiki/5e_SRD:Lesser_Restoration\" title=\"5e SRD:Lesser Restoration\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(6, 69, 173);background:none rgb(253, 249, 211);font-family:sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal\">lesser restoration</a> . If Bleeding is at Stack 3 or higher, you will need <a href=\"https://www.dandwiki.com/wiki/5e_SRD:Greater_Restoration\" title=\"5e SRD:Greater Restoration\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(6, 69, 173);background:none rgb(253, 249, 211);font-family:sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal\">greater restoration</a>. If the weapon used to cause the bleeding has a magical bonus to it, you need to cast a spell slot higher to heal it (eg. +3 longsword needs a lesser restoration of spell slot 5 or higher). Any effect that would stabilize a creature can be used to reduce Bleeding by 1 stage.</span></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
